{"id":"28f4d899d4e85281","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-consistency-hierarchy.md","title":"Consistency Hierarchy","display":"df-consistency-hierarchy — Consistency Hierarchy","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-consistency-hierarchy","aliases":["92-df-consistency-hierarchy"],"display":"df-consistency-hierarchy — Consistency Hierarchy","depends_on":["[[92-df-consistent]]","[[92-df-omega-consistency]]","[[92-df-1-consistency]]","[[92-df-sound-system]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-consistency-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-consistency-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-consistency-hierarchy — Consistency Hierarchy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b15ebe94f199828c\" href=\"?note=b15ebe94f199828c\" title=\"92-df-omega-consistency\">92-df-omega-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6fc24b4011f16912\" href=\"?note=6fc24b4011f16912\" title=\"92-df-1-consistency\">92-df-1-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d76d3a84b374975c\" href=\"?note=d76d3a84b374975c\" title=\"92-df-sound-system\">92-df-sound-system</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span> (consistency predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span> (omega-consistency predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b15ebe94f199828c\" href=\"?note=b15ebe94f199828c\" title=\"92-df-omega-consistency\">92-df-omega-consistency</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span> (1-consistency predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6fc24b4011f16912\" href=\"?note=6fc24b4011f16912\" title=\"92-df-1-consistency\">92-df-1-consistency</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\\)</span> (arithmetical soundness of the formal system, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d76d3a84b374975c\" href=\"?note=d76d3a84b374975c\" title=\"92-df-sound-system\">92-df-sound-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H_G\">\\(\\mathcal H_G\\)</span> (definition-target ordered consistency-condition tuple)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\mathcal H_G\\coloneqq\n\\langle\n\\mathrm{Con}(G),\n1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G),\n\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G),\n\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\n\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\mathcal H_G\\coloneqq\n\\langle\n\\mathrm{Con}(G),\n1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G),\n\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G),\n\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\n\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>对含有足够基本算术的理论，常用蕴含方向为：可靠 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Rightarrow\\omega\">\\(\\Rightarrow\\omega\\)</span>一致 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Rightarrow 1\">\\(\\Rightarrow 1\\)</span>一致 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Rightarrow\">\\(\\Rightarrow\\)</span> 一致</li>\n<li>该元组按由弱到强记录同一个形式系统上的四个条件，避免最后一项突然改以理论集<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span>为参数</li>\n<li>蕴含与严格性必须在附加算术强度条件下另行证明；元组本身不是这些定理的证明</li>\n<li>Gödel原始证明需要<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>一致性</li>\n<li>Rosser改进只需普通一致性</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-omega-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"b15ebe94f199828c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-omega-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-1-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"6fc24b4011f16912","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-1-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sound-system","status":"resolved","id":"d76d3a84b374975c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sound-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Con}(G)$ (consistency predicate, see [[92-df-consistent]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-omega-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"b15ebe94f199828c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)$ (omega-consistency predicate, see [[92-df-omega-consistency]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-1-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"6fc24b4011f16912","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)$ (1-consistency predicate, see [[92-df-1-consistency]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sound-system","status":"resolved","id":"d76d3a84b374975c","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sound}(G)$ (arithmetical soundness of the formal system, see [[92-df-sound-system]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sound}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal H_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\mathcal H_G\\coloneqq\n\\langle\n\\mathrm{Con}(G),\n1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G),\n\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G),\n\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\n\\rangle","display":true},{"tex":"\\Rightarrow\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\Rightarrow 1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Rightarrow","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Th}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1564,"backlinks":[{"id":"8086f2be7f666ab6","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-26","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[92-df-analytical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetic-truth.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetical-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetical-truth.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-property.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-steps.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[92-df-assignment.md]]\n[[92-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-axiom-check.md]]\n[[92-df-axiom-set.md]]\n[[92-df-axiomatization.md]]\n[[92-df-bounded-arithmetic.md]